# ReDoS in glob/brace tooling. Present only in build/CLI dependency chains
# (npm's bundled node_modules, and tsx/jiti's tinyglobby → picomatch used to load
# TypeScript configs at build time), never in the production HTTP request path.
# brace-expansion@1.1.16 is already ahead of the 1.x backport fix; Trivy's DB only
# records the 5.0.8 fix and flags it regardless. Not runtime-exploitable.
